{"videoId":"NtGlda3878U","title":"Đề luyện nghe N4 · Bài 04","sentenceVersion":"2026-10-04-v1","cues":[{"id":"sentence-0","text":"日本語能力試験長これからN4の会試験を始めます。","start":4.48,"end":13.871,"readings":[{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":0},{"word":"能力","reading":"のうりょく","offset":3},{"word":"試験","reading":"しけん","offset":5},{"word":"長","reading":"ちょう","offset":7},{"word":"会","reading":"かい","offset":15},{"word":"試験","reading":"しけん","offset":16},{"word":"始め","reading":"はじめ","offset":19}]},{"id":"sentence-1","text":"問題用紙にメモを取っても構いません。","start":13.871,"end":20.913,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":2},{"word":"取っ","reading":"とっ","offset":8},{"word":"構い","reading":"かまい","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-2","text":"問題用紙を開けてください。","start":20.913,"end":26,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":2},{"word":"開け","reading":"あけ","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-3","text":"問題1問題1ではまず質問を聞いてください。","start":28.84,"end":34.972,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":3},{"word":"質問","reading":"しつもん","offset":10},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-4","text":"それから話を聞いて問題用紙の1から4の中から1番いいものを1つ選んでください。","start":34.972,"end":46.36,"readings":[{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":4},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":6},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":9},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":11},{"word":"中","reading":"なか","offset":19},{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":23},{"word":"選ん","reading":"えらん","offset":31}]},{"id":"sentence-5","text":"1番電話で女の人と男の人が話しています。","start":48.559,"end":54.114,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"電話","reading":"でんわ","offset":2},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":5},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":7},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":9},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":11},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-6","text":"女の人は何を買っていきますか?","start":54.114,"end":58.28,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":4},{"word":"買っ","reading":"かっ","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-7","text":"もしもし。","start":59.92,"end":60.404,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-8","text":"明日のパーティーなんだけど飲み物何か買っていこうか?","start":60.404,"end":62.92,"readings":[{"word":"明日","reading":"あした","offset":0},{"word":"飲み物","reading":"のみもの","offset":13},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":16},{"word":"買っ","reading":"かっ","offset":18}]},{"id":"sentence-9","text":"えっと、オレンジジュースとコーラをお願いできる?","start":65.76,"end":68.76,"readings":[{"word":"お願い","reading":"おねがい","offset":17}]},{"id":"sentence-10","text":"うん、いいよ。","start":69.759,"end":71.159,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-11","text":"他には何かある?","start":71.159,"end":72.759,"readings":[{"word":"他","reading":"た","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-12","text":"あ、それと氷も持ってきてくれる?","start":72.92,"end":75.6,"readings":[{"word":"氷","reading":"こおり","offset":5},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-13","text":"氷ね。","start":75.6,"end":76.185,"readings":[{"word":"氷","reading":"こおり","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-14","text":"分かった。","start":76.185,"end":77.159,"readings":[{"word":"分かっ","reading":"わかっ","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-15","text":"あ、ちょっと待って。","start":77.159,"end":77.826,"readings":[{"word":"待っ","reading":"まっ","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-16","text":"コーラは冷凍庫にたくさんあるから大丈夫だ。","start":77.826,"end":79.226,"readings":[{"word":"冷凍庫","reading":"れいとうこ","offset":4},{"word":"大丈夫","reading":"だいじょうぶ","offset":16}]},{"id":"sentence-17","text":"それより紙コップもお願いね。","start":79.226,"end":80.159,"readings":[{"word":"紙","reading":"かみ","offset":4},{"word":"お願い","reading":"おねがい","offset":9}]},{"id":"sentence-18","text":"うん。","start":84.32,"end":85.835,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-19","text":"わかった。","start":85.835,"end":88.36,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-20","text":"女の人は何を買っていきますか?","start":91.24,"end":96.88,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":4},{"word":"買っ","reading":"かっ","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-21","text":"2番、男の人とジムの人が話してい男の人はどのコースを選びましたか?","start":116.64,"end":125.079,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":3},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":5},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":10},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":12},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":16},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":18},{"word":"選び","reading":"えらび","offset":26}]},{"id":"sentence-22","text":"すみません。","start":127.32,"end":128.04,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-23","text":"ジムのコースについて聞きたいんですが。","start":128.04,"end":130.32,"readings":[{"word":"聞き","reading":"きき","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-24","text":"はい。","start":131.44,"end":132.005,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-25","text":"コースは3つあります。","start":132.005,"end":134.075,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-26","text":"月に3000円のAコース、5000円のBコース、8000円のCコースです。","start":134.075,"end":141.04,"readings":[{"word":"月","reading":"つき","offset":0},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":6},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":17},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":28}]},{"id":"sentence-27","text":"うーん。","start":141.04,"end":141.925,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-28","text":"Cコースは高いですね。","start":141.925,"end":144.36,"readings":[{"word":"高い","reading":"たかい","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-29","text":"Bコースにしようかな。","start":144.36,"end":146.44,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-30","text":"コースは月曜日から金曜日だけ使えます。","start":146.44,"end":149.44,"readings":[{"word":"月曜日","reading":"げつようび","offset":4},{"word":"金曜日","reading":"きんようび","offset":9},{"word":"使え","reading":"つかえ","offset":14}]},{"id":"sentence-31","text":"土曜日と日曜日も使いたい場合はCコースになります。","start":150.239,"end":154.44,"readings":[{"word":"土曜日","reading":"どようび","offset":0},{"word":"日曜日","reading":"にちようび","offset":4},{"word":"使い","reading":"つかい","offset":8},{"word":"場合","reading":"ばあい","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-32","text":"あ、そうですか。","start":154.44,"end":155.978,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-33","text":"土日も使いたいんですよね。","start":155.978,"end":158.478,"readings":[{"word":"土日","reading":"どにち","offset":0},{"word":"使い","reading":"つかい","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-34","text":"でも8000円はちょっとあ、今月だけCコースが6500円になっています。","start":158.478,"end":165.4,"readings":[{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":6},{"word":"今月","reading":"こんげつ","offset":14},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":27}]},{"id":"sentence-35","text":"え、それはいいですね。","start":165.4,"end":166.835,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-36","text":"じゃあそれお願いします。","start":166.835,"end":168.4,"readings":[{"word":"お願い","reading":"おねがい","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-37","text":"ありがとうございます。","start":169.08,"end":170.18,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-38","text":"ではこちらの神に名前を書いてください。","start":170.18,"end":172.08,"readings":[{"word":"神","reading":"かみ","offset":6},{"word":"名前","reading":"なまえ","offset":8},{"word":"書い","reading":"かい","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-39","text":"男の人はどのコースを選びましたか?","start":178.68,"end":184.84,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"選び","reading":"えらび","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-40","text":"番部屋で女の人と男の人が話しています。","start":205.08,"end":206.709,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":0},{"word":"部屋","reading":"へや","offset":1},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":4},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":6},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":8},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":10},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-41","text":"男の人はどこに本棚を置きますか?","start":206.709,"end":208.08,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"本棚","reading":"ほんだな","offset":7},{"word":"置き","reading":"おき","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-42","text":"ねえ、この本棚に置けばいい?","start":216.04,"end":219.04,"readings":[{"word":"本棚","reading":"ほんだな","offset":5},{"word":"置け","reading":"おけ","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-43","text":"まずは窓のそばに置こうかな。","start":219.84,"end":222.28,"readings":[{"word":"窓","reading":"まど","offset":3},{"word":"置こ","reading":"おこ","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-44","text":"でも窓のそばだと本が日に焼けてしまうよ。","start":222.28,"end":225.28,"readings":[{"word":"窓","reading":"まど","offset":2},{"word":"本","reading":"ほん","offset":8},{"word":"日","reading":"ひ","offset":10},{"word":"焼け","reading":"やけ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-45","text":"そうか。","start":226.519,"end":227.181,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-46","text":"じゃあベッドの横はうーん。","start":227.181,"end":229.334,"readings":[{"word":"横","reading":"よこ","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-47","text":"ベッドの横だと通る時に邪魔にならない。","start":229.334,"end":232.48,"readings":[{"word":"横","reading":"よこ","offset":4},{"word":"通る","reading":"とおる","offset":7},{"word":"時","reading":"とき","offset":9},{"word":"邪魔","reading":"じゃま","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-48","text":"うーん。","start":234.159,"end":234.68,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-49","text":"うん。","start":234.68,"end":234.98,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-50","text":"どこがいいだろうね。","start":234.98,"end":235.98,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-51","text":"あ、そうだ。","start":235.98,"end":236.58,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-52","text":"そこのテレビの近くは?","start":236.58,"end":237.68,"readings":[{"word":"近く","reading":"ちかく","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-53","text":"そこもいいけど、実はテレビの近くはね、花瓶を置こうと思っているの。","start":240.36,"end":241.907,"readings":[{"word":"実は","reading":"じつは","offset":8},{"word":"近く","reading":"ちかく","offset":14},{"word":"花瓶","reading":"かびん","offset":19},{"word":"置こ","reading":"おこ","offset":22},{"word":"思っ","reading":"おもっ","offset":26}]},{"id":"sentence-54","text":"だからドアの近くに置いた方がいいかなと思っているけどどう思う?","start":241.907,"end":243.36,"readings":[{"word":"近く","reading":"ちかく","offset":6},{"word":"置い","reading":"おい","offset":9},{"word":"方","reading":"ほう","offset":12},{"word":"思っ","reading":"おもっ","offset":19},{"word":"思う","reading":"おもう","offset":28}]},{"id":"sentence-55","text":"うん、分かった。","start":251.76,"end":253.474,"readings":[{"word":"分かっ","reading":"わかっ","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-56","text":"そうしよう。","start":253.474,"end":254.76,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-57","text":"男の人はどこに本棚を置きますか?","start":259.479,"end":265.72,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"本棚","reading":"ほんだな","offset":7},{"word":"置き","reading":"おき","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-58","text":"4番ペットの店で女の人が話しています。","start":285.52,"end":291.4,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"店","reading":"みせ","offset":6},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":8},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":10},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-59","text":"犬を店で見てもらいたい人は何を持ってこなければなりませんか?","start":291.4,"end":298.24,"readings":[{"word":"犬","reading":"いぬ","offset":0},{"word":"店","reading":"みせ","offset":2},{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":4},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":11},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":13},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":15}]},{"id":"sentence-60","text":"ではワンちゃんを見てもらう時に必要なものについてご説明します。","start":298.24,"end":303.855,"readings":[{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":8},{"word":"時","reading":"とき","offset":13},{"word":"必要","reading":"ひつよう","offset":15},{"word":"説明","reading":"せつめい","offset":25}]},{"id":"sentence-61","text":"まずいつも使っている餌を持ってきてください。","start":303.855,"end":307.84,"readings":[{"word":"使っ","reading":"つかっ","offset":5},{"word":"餌","reading":"えさ","offset":10},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-62","text":"こちらの餌に慣れていないと体調を壊してしまうことがありますので、そして最近寒くなってきましたので、温かい毛布があれば持ってきてくれたら助かります。","start":307.84,"end":319.8,"readings":[{"word":"餌","reading":"えさ","offset":4},{"word":"慣れ","reading":"なれ","offset":6},{"word":"体調","reading":"たいちょう","offset":13},{"word":"壊し","reading":"こわし","offset":16},{"word":"最近","reading":"さいきん","offset":35},{"word":"寒く","reading":"さむく","offset":37},{"word":"温かい","reading":"あたたかい","offset":49},{"word":"毛布","reading":"もうふ","offset":52},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":58},{"word":"助かり","reading":"たすかり","offset":67}]},{"id":"sentence-63","text":"もしなくてもこちらで用意したものを使いますので大丈夫です。","start":319.8,"end":325.774,"readings":[{"word":"用意","reading":"ようい","offset":10},{"word":"使い","reading":"つかい","offset":17},{"word":"大丈夫","reading":"だいじょうぶ","offset":23}]},{"id":"sentence-64","text":"それから首輪はこちらで貸しますので持ってこなくても大丈夫です。","start":325.774,"end":332.16,"readings":[{"word":"首輪","reading":"くびわ","offset":4},{"word":"貸し","reading":"かし","offset":11},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":17},{"word":"大丈夫","reading":"だいじょうぶ","offset":25}]},{"id":"sentence-65","text":"何を持ってこなければなりませんか?","start":335.319,"end":340.4,"readings":[{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":0},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-66","text":"5番図書館で受付の人が話しています。","start":359.759,"end":365.199,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"図書館","reading":"としょかん","offset":2},{"word":"受付","reading":"うけつけ","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":9},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-67","text":"予約してない人は本を受け取るために何をしなければなりませんか?","start":365.199,"end":372.44,"readings":[{"word":"予約","reading":"よやく","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":6},{"word":"本","reading":"ほん","offset":8},{"word":"受け取る","reading":"うけとる","offset":10},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":17}]},{"id":"sentence-68","text":"では本の受け取り方法をご説明します。","start":372.44,"end":376.919,"readings":[{"word":"本","reading":"ほん","offset":2},{"word":"受け取り","reading":"うけとり","offset":4},{"word":"方法","reading":"ほうほう","offset":8},{"word":"説明","reading":"せつめい","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-69","text":"まず予約した方は受付で予約表と会員症を見せてください。","start":376.919,"end":382.973,"readings":[{"word":"予約","reading":"よやく","offset":2},{"word":"方","reading":"ほう","offset":6},{"word":"受付","reading":"うけつけ","offset":8},{"word":"予約","reading":"よやく","offset":11},{"word":"表","reading":"ひょう","offset":13},{"word":"会員","reading":"かいいん","offset":15},{"word":"症","reading"